==Appearance==
<tabber>
|-|Default=
Soulvester is a pale green ghost haunting a suit of armor. He wears a large gray helmet, which obscures most of his face. The helmet features a visor with three rectangular gaps and a notched base with a teal, rhombus-shaped gem that has pale green lining along the sides. On top of his helmet is a long, teal, droplet-shaped piece that pokes out from a circular base in a similar fashion to that of a ponytail. His armor also consists of a breastplate, gauntlets, greaves, and darker sabatons, all of which are gray. His dialogue with {{CI|Ribecca|name=true}} reveals that there are actually scratches on his armor, despite there being none visible on his model. He wears black cloth, covering the parts of his torso and legs that are not armored. It is currently unknown what he looks like without his armor. During [[Blackouts]], he emits a teal glow.
|-|Vintage=
Vintage Soulvester's armor pieces are now a darker gray color and his eyes visible through the helmet are pie-cut along the left. The teal parts of him, being his helmet's ponytail-esque piece and gem, are now gray while his lighter teal parts, including his arms, the lining on the sides of his gem, and his eyelids, are now white. The glow he emits is now white.
|-|Haunted Flame=
Haunted Flame Soulvester wears a dark, muted purple armor suit with droplet-shaped slits on the visor and has splotches of [[Ichor]] on the ends of the breastplate, gauntlets, greaves, and seemingly all over his arms. The ends of his gauntlets and top of his helmet where his teardrop-shaped piece pokes out are covered with white, fluffy chunks of candle wax. His ponytail and cloth are now white and fade into pink and the ends. The glow he emits is now pink.
|-|Gourd Guard=
Gourd Guard Soulvester has orange armor with darker stripes on the helmet, breastplate, and greaves, resembling that of a pumpkin, along with his helmet top, gauntlets, and sabatons with an even deeper shade of orange. His visor has a jagged, smile-like gap and his ponytail-esque piece is green and gradients into a slightly darker shade at the tip. He lacks a helmet base and is replaced with a green cape that comes with a more rounded base and a lighter stripe resembling a curled vine with leaves, placed near the ends' front and back. Its gem is green with two short, curled vines coming out from it. The glow he emits is now orange.
|-|Golden Knight=
Golden Knight Soulvester has yellow armor. His visor is shiny with a deeper, golden yellow color and is crown-shaped with small, elliptical gaps, the center slightly larger. He wears a gold crown with six spikes, a red oval ornamenting each, around his ponytail-esque piece, which is red with a gold fade and it's also decorated with yellow stars. He wears a reddish-orange shawl with white, red-dotted, cloudy lining connected by a red oval gem. He wears a cape of the same hue and it ends in the same lining. His breastplate is a gold yellow with two yellow stars on the left, while his gauntlets and greaves have a golden trim. On his greaves, he has red gems similar to the one on his helmet, slightly below the trim. He also emits a faint golden glow, along with small yellow twinkles. The glow he emits is now gold yellow.
|-|Spooky-Time=
[[Spooky-Time Cosmetic Pack|Spooky-Time]] Soulvester wears multi-colored armor. His helmet, without the base, is a light purple with a darker visor that has three narrower, rounded line gaps, with the middle being slightly longer and a horizontal line crossing though the visor, making the gap resemble a stitch. The ponytail-esque piece on his helmet is pink with an amber gradient at the end and also has rotating pattern of spider webs and dots, colored with a pink and yellow gradient. The helmet has shiny bolts on the sides, with an amber blot on the left and a dark purple on the right. His gem is now an amber lightning-bolt shape attached to jagged, cream colored fluff collar which is part of a cape. The cape also has jagged cream fluff around it, and it's also notably larger at the left, where it forms a pad over his left shoulder. The exterior and interior design are a solid dark purple and amber-pink gradient respectively, with both sides using the web and dot pattern like the helmet's top piece. His breastplate, left gauntlet, right greave and sabaton are amber, while his right gauntlet, left greave and sabaton are faded purple. He also now wears a round, amber pauldron on his right shoulder. Both greaves have a black stitch and amber bolts with dark purple covers on the sides, and his sabatons have black soles. The black cloth also now covers his arms, and he wears two magenta belts, one of which with a golden buckle and overlaps the other while sagging toward the right; vice versa for the other belt. When moving, he creates a transparent, pink and yellow trail of waves and spider webs that expands and then fades away. He produces spider web fragments of the same color that grow into full webs before disappearing.
