==Requirement Strategies==
*For the first requirement, focus on picking up {{II|Pumpkins|name=true}} and extracting [[Machines]]. The Machine and Pumpkin count increases the further you descend, so you can earn more Pumpkins.
*For the second requirement, have a Distractor [[Toon]] bring {{CI|Twisted Soulvester|name=true}} to the [[Elevator]] to you so you can get aggro. Playing as {{CI|Rodger|name=true}} also helps getting Research faster because of his Passive [[Ability]]. This will be easier if Twisted Soulvester is on the [[Daily Twisted Board]].
